<title>GERMANY: Buba's Koebnick - dollar supported by fundamentals.</title>
<headline>Buba's Koebnick - dollar supported by fundamentals.</headline>
<dateline>MERZIG, Germany 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Hans-Juergen Koebnick said on Wednesday that current U.S. economic fundamentals supported the U.S. dollar/mark exchange rate.</p>
<p>&quot;The dollar is presently supported by fundamentals,&quot; Koebnick said after holding a speech here.</p>
</text>
